rem Snippet: Keyboard Movement
rem Description: Drive an object with the arrow keys. Call MoveWithKeys(object number, speed, turn speed) once per frame.

function MoveWithKeys(Obj, Speed#, TurnSpeed#)
   if upkey() = 1 then move object Obj, Speed#
   if downkey() = 1 then move object Obj, 0 - Speed#
   if leftkey() = 1 then yrotate object Obj, wrapvalue(object angle y(Obj) - TurnSpeed#)
   if rightkey() = 1 then yrotate object Obj, wrapvalue(object angle y(Obj) + TurnSpeed#)
endfunction
